{"role":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"当前 Cursor 工作区（`empty-window`）和你的用户目录里都没有找到你的测评项目 `index.html`，无法直接在你那份文件上改。我们正在工作区生成完整的首页、`about.html`、社群占位页，以及带合并说明与「智能点击开始测评」的接入结构；你把原来的测评 DOM 和脚本放进 `#zhilu-legacy-root` 后，「开始免费测评」会隐藏首页并尽量自动触发原来的「开始测评」按钮。\n\n[REDACTED]"},{"type":"tool_use","name":"Write","input":{"path":"C:\\Users\\cloud\\.cursor\\projects\\empty-window\\about.html","contents":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>关于我们 - 职路导航</title>\n  <style>\n    :root { --primary: #165DFF; --text: #1d2129; --muted: #4e5969; --bg: #f7f8fa; }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.65; min-height: 100vh; }\n    header { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; background: rgba(255,255,255,.92); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e6eb; }\n    .wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }\n    .logo { font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.1rem; }\n    .back { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; }\n    .back:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n    main { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.25rem 3rem; }\n    h1 { font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 4vw, 1.75rem); margin: 0 0 1rem; }\n    .placeholder { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px dashed #c9cdd4; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <a class=\"logo\" href=\"index.html\">职路导航</a>\n      <a class=\"back\" href=\"index.html\">返回首页</a>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <main>\n    <h1>关于我们</h1>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">\n      <p>这里是「关于我们」说明页占位区。你可以在此补充团队介绍、产品理念、联系方式等内容。</p>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","name":"Write","input":{"path":"C:\\Users\\cloud\\.cursor\\projects\\empty-window\\community.html","contents":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>加入同路人社群 - 职路导航</title>\n  <style>\n    :root { --primary: #165DFF; --text: #1d2129; --muted: #4e5969; --bg: #f7f8fa; }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); min-height: 100vh; }\n    header { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; background: rgba(255,255,255,.92); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e6eb; }\n    .wrap { max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }\n    .logo { font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.1rem; }\n    .back { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; }\n    .back:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n    main { max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.25rem 3rem; text-align: center; }\n    h1 { font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 1.5rem); margin: 0 0 1rem; }\n    .qr-box { margin: 1.5rem auto 0; max-width: 280px; aspect-ratio: 1; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e6eb; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 1rem; }\n    .hint { margin-top: 1.25rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; }\n    .link-btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--primary); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; }\n    .link-btn:hover { background: #0e4bd9; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <a class=\"logo\" href=\"index.html\">职路导航</a>\n      <a class=\"back\" href=\"index.html\">返回首页</a>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <main>\n    <h1>加入同路人社群</h1>\n    <p class=\"hint\">将下方链接改为你自己的微信群 / 企业微信加群链接，或把二维码图片放到此页替换占位区。</p>\n    <!-- 替换 href：例如企业微信加群链接或活码 -->\n    <a class=\"link-btn\" id=\"wx-group-link\" href=\"#\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">点击打开加群（请替换链接）</a>\n    <div class=\"qr-box\" id=\"qr-placeholder\" aria-label=\"微信群二维码占位\">\n      二维码图片占位<br />可替换为 &lt;img src=\"qrcode.png\" alt=\"微信群二维码\" /&gt;\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"hint\">在 <code>community.html</code> 中修改 <code>#wx-group-link</code> 的 <code>href</code>，或用图片替换 <code>#qr-placeholder</code>。</p>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}]}}
{"role":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[REDACTED]"},{"type":"tool_use","name":"Write","input":{"path":"C:\\Users\\cloud\\.cursor\\projects\\empty-window\\index.html","contents":"<!--\n  合并说明（保留你原有测评逻辑时）：\n  1. 将你原 index.html 中 <body> 里「测评」相关的整块 HTML（含题目区、结果区、原有按钮等）以及页面底部的 <script>…</script> 一并剪切到下方 <div id=\"zhilu-legacy-root\"> 内，替换其中的占位提示。\n  2. 删掉原页面里与旧首页/欢迎页重复的标题与「开始测评」按钮（避免重复显示）；若保留原按钮也可，新首页的「开始免费测评」会尝试自动点击第一个「开始测评」类按钮。\n  3. 若原脚本依赖写在 <head> 里的外链，请把对应 <link>/<script> 一并保留在本文件 <head> 中。\n-->\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>职路导航 - 考研 / 考公 / 就业规划测评</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --primary: #165DFF;\n      --primary-hover: #0e4bd9;\n      --text: #1d2129;\n      --muted: #4e5969;\n      --subtle: #86909c;\n      --bg: #f7f8fa;\n      --card: #ffffff;\n      --border: #e5e6eb;\n      --nav-h: 56px;\n    }\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      color: var(--text);\n      background: var(--bg);\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n    a { color: inherit; }\n\n    /* —— 新首页：导航 —— */\n    .zhilu-nav {\n      position: fixed;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      z-index: 100;\n      height: var(--nav-h);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);\n      transition: background 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;\n    }\n    .zhilu-nav.is-scrolled {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n      box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n    }\n    .zhilu-nav__logo {\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.8vw, 1.2rem);\n      color: var(--primary);\n      text-decoration: none;\n      letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n    }\n    .zhilu-nav__logo:hover { opacity: 0.9; }\n    .zhilu-nav__about {\n      font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 2.2vw, 0.9rem);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      text-decoration: none;\n    }\n    .zhilu-nav__about:hover { color: var(--primary); }\n\n    /* —— 新首页：区块通用 —— */\n    #zhilu-landing-page { padding-top: var(--nav-h); }\n    .zhilu-section {\n      max-width: 1120px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem) clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2rem);\n    }\n    .zhilu-hero {\n      text-align: center;\n      padding-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\n    }\n    .zhilu-hero__title {\n      margin: 0 auto 1rem;\n      max-width: 18em;\n      font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 5vw, 2.35rem);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #000;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n    }\n    .zhilu-hero__sub {\n      margin: 0 auto 2rem;\n      max-width: 36em;\n      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.8vw, 1.125rem);\n      color: var(--muted);\n    }\n    .zhilu-btn-primary {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      min-height: 52px;\n      padding: 0.85rem clamp(2rem, 8vw, 3.5rem);\n      width: min(100%, 420px);\n      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 3vw, 1.2rem);\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #fff;\n      background: var(--primary);\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(22, 93, 255, 0.28);\n      transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n    }\n    .zhilu-btn-primary:hover {\n      background: var(--primary-hover);\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(22, 93, 255, 0.32);\n    }\n    .zhilu-btn-primary:active { transform: scale(0.98); }\n    .zhilu-hero__note {\n      margin-top: 1rem;\n      font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 2.4vw, 0.9rem);\n      color: var(--subtle);\n    }\n\n    /* 优势卡片 */\n    .zhilu-cards {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      .zhilu-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    }\n    .zhilu-card {\n      background: var(--card);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);\n      transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n    }\n    .zhilu-card:hover {\n      border-color: rgba(22, 93, 255, 0.25);\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(22, 93, 255, 0.08);\n    }\n    .zhilu-card__icon {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 44px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      background: rgba(22, 93, 255, 0.08);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem;\n      color: var(--primary);\n    }\n    .zhilu-card__icon svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }\n    .zhilu-card__title {\n      margin: 0 0 0.5rem;\n      font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 2.6vw, 1.1rem);\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n    .zhilu-card__desc {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: clamp(0.92rem, 2.4vw, 0.98rem);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      line-height: 1.65;\n    }\n\n    /* 评价 */\n    .zhilu-testimonials {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n      gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      .zhilu-testimonials { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    }\n    .zhilu-quote {\n      background: var(--card);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .zhilu-quote__text {\n      margin: 0 0 1rem;\n      font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2.5vw, 1.02rem);\n      color: var(--text);\n    }\n    .zhilu-quote__by {\n      font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 2.3vw, 0.9rem);\n      color: var(--subtle);\n    }\n\n    /* 底部 */\n    .zhilu-footer {\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem) 1.25rem 2rem;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    .zhilu-footer__tag {\n      margin: 0 0 1rem;\n      font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 2.5vw, 0.95rem);\n      color: var(--muted);\n    }\n    .zhilu-btn-outline {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      min-height: 44px;\n      padding: 0.55rem 1.35rem;\n      font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 2.4vw, 0.95rem);\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--primary);\n      background: #fff;\n      border: 2px solid var(--primary);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;\n    }\n    .zhilu-btn-outline:hover {\n      background: rgba(22, 93, 255, 0.06);\n      border-color: var(--primary-hover);\n      color: var(--primary-hover);\n    }\n    .zhilu-footer__copy {\n      margin: 1.5rem 0 0;\n      font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 2.2vw, 0.85rem);\n      color: var(--subtle);\n    }\n\n    /* 滚动淡入 */\n    .reveal {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(14px);\n      transition: opacity 0.55s ease, transform 0.55s ease;\n    }\n    .reveal.is-visible {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: none;\n    }\n\n    /* 原测评区：合并后显示 */\n    #zhilu-legacy-root {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      background: var(--bg);\n    }\n    #zhilu-legacy-root[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n    .zhilu-merge-placeholder {\n      max-width: 640px;\n      margin: 2rem auto;\n      padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);\n      background: #fff;\n      border: 1px dashed var(--primary);\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2.5vw, 1rem);\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    .zhilu-merge-placeholder strong { color: var(--text); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <!-- 新首页 -->\n  <div id=\"zhilu-landing-page\">\n    <header class=\"zhilu-nav\" id=\"zhilu-nav\" role=\"banner\">\n      <a class=\"zhilu-nav__logo\" href=\"index.html\">职路导航</a>\n      <a class=\"zhilu-nav__about\" href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"zhilu-section zhilu-hero\">\n      <h1 class=\"zhilu-hero__title reveal\">还在纠结考研/考公/就业？3分钟帮你找对路</h1>\n      <p class=\"zhilu-hero__sub reveal\">不用盲目跟风，结合你的性格、家庭、能力，给你最适合的专属规划，一站式搞定所有备考信息</p>\n      <div class=\"reveal\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"zhilu-btn-primary\" id=\"zhilu-btn-start-free\">开始免费测评</button>\n        <p class=\"zhilu-hero__note\">已有1200+大学生完成测评，帮他们摆脱迷茫</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"zhilu-section\" aria-labelledby=\"zhilu-adv-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"zhilu-adv-title\" class=\"visually-hidden\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0;\">产品优势</h2>\n      <div class=\"zhilu-cards\">\n        <article class=\"zhilu-card reveal\">\n          <div class=\"zhilu-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 21s-6-5.33-6-10a6 6 0 1 1 12 0c0 4.67-6 10-6 10z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"zhilu-card__title\">专属个性化推荐</h3>\n          <p class=\"zhilu-card__desc\">不是通用的性格测评，结合你的家庭条件、能力，推荐你真的能走的路，不是空中楼阁</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"zhilu-card reveal\">\n          <div class=\"zhilu-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5l2-3h6l2 3h5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"zhilu-card__title\">一站式信息整合</h3>\n          <p class=\"zhilu-card__desc\">不用跑5个平台找信息，考公/考研/就业的报名时间、岗位数据、备考资料，全在这</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"zhilu-card reveal\">\n          <div class=\"zhilu-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"zhilu-card__title\">全程免费无广告</h3>\n          <p class=\"zhilu-card__desc\">我们只想帮你少走弯路，所有功能都免费，没有隐藏收费，没有乱七八糟的广告</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"zhilu-section\" aria-labelledby=\"zhilu-test-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"zhilu-test-title\" class=\"visually-hidden\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0;\">用户评价</h2>\n      <div class=\"zhilu-testimonials\">\n        <figure class=\"zhilu-quote reveal\">\n          <blockquote class=\"zhilu-quote__text\">之前纠结了半年，不知道该考研还是考公，测完之后一下子就想通了，现在已经开始准备考公了！</blockquote>\n          <figcaption class=\"zhilu-quote__by\">大三 · 汉语言文学</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure class=\"zhilu-quote reveal\">\n          <blockquote class=\"zhilu-quote__text\">原来以为自己适合考研，结果测完发现就业更适合我，现在已经拿到了心仪的offer！</blockquote>\n          <figcaption class=\"zhilu-quote__by\">大四 · 计算机</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"zhilu-footer\">\n      <p class=\"zhilu-footer__tag\">职路导航 · 帮你找到最适合你的职业方向</p>\n      <a class=\"zhilu-btn-outline\" href=\"community.html\">加入同路人社群</a>\n      <p class=\"zhilu-footer__copy\">© 2026 职路导航 版权所有</p>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 将你原来的测评页面主体（DOM + 脚本）合并到下方区域内，替换占位说明 -->\n  <div id=\"zhilu-legacy-root\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"zhilu-merge-placeholder\" id=\"zhilu-merge-placeholder\">\n      <p><strong>测评区尚未合并。</strong>请打开本文件顶部的注释说明，把你原 <code>index.html</code> 里与测评相关的 HTML 与 <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> 剪切到 <code>#zhilu-legacy-root</code> 中，并删除本占位框。</p>\n      <p>合并完成后，点击首页「开始免费测评」将隐藏本首页并进入你原来的测评流程（脚本会尝试自动点击「开始测评」类按钮）。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      var nav = document.getElementById(\"zhilu-nav\");\n      function onScroll() {\n        if (!nav) return;\n        if (window.scrollY > 8) nav.classList.add(\"is-scrolled\");\n        else nav.classList.remove(\"is-scrolled\");\n      }\n      window.addEventListener(\"scroll\", onScroll, { passive: true });\n      onScroll();\n\n      var reveals = document.querySelectorAll(\".reveal\");\n      if (\"IntersectionObserver\" in window) {\n        var io = new IntersectionObserver(\n          function (entries) {\n            entries.forEach(function (e) {\n              if (e.isIntersecting) e.target.classList.add(\"is-visible\");\n            });\n          },\n          { root: null, rootMargin: \"0px 0px -8% 0px\", threshold: 0.08 }\n        );\n        reveals.forEach(function (el) { io.observe(el); });\n      } else {\n        reveals.forEach(function (el) { el.classList.add(\"is-visible\"); });\n      }\n\n      function findStartControl(root) {\n        if (!root) return null;\n        var sel = [\n          \"#startBtn\", \"#start\", \"#btn-start\", \"#btnStart\", \"#startQuiz\",\n          \"[data-start-quiz]\", \"[data-action='start']\", \".btn-start\"\n        ];\n        for (var i = 0; i < sel.length; i++) {\n          var el = root.querySelector(sel[i]);\n          if (el) return el;\n        }\n        var candidates = root.querySelectorAll(\"button, a[role='button'], a.btn, .btn\");\n        for (var j = 0; j < candidates.length; j++) {\n          var t = (candidates[j].textContent || \"\").replace(/\\s+/g, \"\");\n          if (/开始.*测评|开始测评|开始评测|立即测评|开始测试/.test(t)) return candidates[j];\n        }\n        return null;\n      }\n\n      function enterAssessment() {\n        var landing = document.getElementById(\"zhilu-landing-page\");\n        var legacy = document.getElementById(\"zhilu-legacy-root\");\n        var placeholder = document.getElementById(\"zhilu-merge-placeholder\");\n\n        if (placeholder && placeholder.isConnected) {\n          landing.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \"smooth\", block: \"start\" });\n          placeholder.style.boxShadow = \"0 0 0 3px rgba(22,93,255,0.35)\";\n          setTimeout(function () { placeholder.style.boxShadow = \"\"; }, 1400);\n          return;\n        }\n\n        if (landing) landing.hidden = true;\n        if (legacy) {\n          legacy.hidden = false;\n          document.body.style.background = \"\";\n        }\n        window.scrollTo(0, 0);\n\n        requestAnimationFrame(function () {\n          var startEl = findStartControl(legacy);\n          if (startEl && typeof startEl.click === \"function\") startEl.click();\n        });\n      }\n\n      var startFree = document.getElementById(\"zhilu-btn-start-free\");\n      if (startFree) startFree.addEventListener(\"click\", enterAssessment);\n    })();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}]}}
